    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Lifecycle cleanup\n\nUnleash sends a webhook on every flag event. This template picks out the lifecycle events that call for cleanup — **potentially stale** and **completed** — and opens a Jira ticket for the flag's creator, so the team that owns it gets a reminder instead of letting it linger.\n\n**Setup:**\n1. In Unleash, go to Integrations > Webhook and point it at this workflow's Production URL, with the same secret in the Authorization header.\n2. Add an n8n Header Auth credential for that secret.\n3. Connect your own Jira credential, then pick a Project and Issue Type on **Create Jira Issue**.\n\nWorks on every Unleash plan.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 460
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [-520, -160],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "d3b1841e-0ceb-4728-b5a8-0734a8cb5e5f",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Receive and route events\n\nUnleash posts a batch of events to the webhook in one request. **Split Lifecycle Events** turns `body.events` into one item per event, then **Route Lifecycle Events** keeps only `feature-potentially-stale-on` and `feature-completed` — every other event type is dropped here.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [-16, -200],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "05255e02-16bc-47ce-9c70-5be6806f9926",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Deduplicate and create the ticket\n\nUnleash retries a failed webhook delivery once, so the same event can arrive twice. **Deduplicate by Event ID** compares each event's `id` against what this workflow has already processed and drops repeats, then **Create Jira Issue** opens one ticket per unique event.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [656, -320],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "40acf44f-dc9e-4735-8a3f-c2769effef56",
      "name": "Sticky Note2"
    }
  ],
